- **Project**: Spotube
- **Repository**: https://github.com/team-spotube/spotube
- **License**: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
- **Copyright**: (c) Kingkor Roy Tirtho and Spotube contributors
- **Referenced Scope**: Cross-platform audio playback pipeline, SponsorBlock chapter segment handling, yt-dlp download orchestration, Piped proxy routing, audio normalization, and local file metadata tagging.
